{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/15ac5ff5b4df17a75e9ca7b9c4129f9a.avif?t=1773323996\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a barista and manage your very own coffee shop in <strong>Coffee Express</strong>, a first-person simulation game where every cup matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare delicious drinks, satisfy your customers, and grow your caf\u00e9 into the most beloved coffee spot in town. From grinding beans to crafting the perfect latte, every detail of the coffee-making process is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're carefully following recipes or experimenting with your own style, Coffee Express offers a relaxing and immersive caf\u00e9 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/2de79da92adb57a74120263811b5a559.avif?t=1773323996\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Own Caf\u00e9</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coffee shop, prepare drinks for customers, and build a reputation as the town\u2019s favorite barista.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Coffee Preparation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use authentic tools and machines such as espresso machines, portafilters, and coffee grinders to craft different types of coffee drinks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Barista Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drink requires multiple steps and ingredients. Master the workflow and create the perfect cup every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Requests and Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may ask for something special, draw latte art, write funny messages on cups, or experiment with different combinations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Types of Equipment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, new equipment will find its place in your cafe. You will use not only coffee-making equipment, but also different types of equipment to run your cafe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Coffee of Day!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/290fe5d4fb85903ce54fab5bfc918abb6811c8c7.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping List is Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/38f73db1a321fe22eb8ccee81f6f6b1f93f540aa.jpg"},{"name":"It's So Clean!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/1c95b55645ce1b9b49bd4f48d700a0f0729d0df1.jpg"},{"name":"Latte Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/929c59b0b304f2866bf8fed25f15b1b1b53df1f3.jpg"},{"name":"Business is Growing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/52f50049909a4ba9fb6a344e0e9f0f876b94b227.jpg"},{"name":"Flavored Coffees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/ab509b25c75635d4fef1a68ad8072d545fbfdb4a.jpg"},{"name":"Desserts Are On Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/65b7511b85ebc7fda5b5cfc92103de73426d7839.jpg"},{"name":"10 Days Success Story!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3044520/b26e889aee4b2dce910bf74639655a26de4827cb.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044520?t=1773323996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/118fd8da4c698633a3dc84b5b0ce0b94805c550f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773323996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/6ee549200208659bcd742cd85b8ee58c247b3ad2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773323996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/6ee549200208659bcd742cd85b8ee58c247b3ad2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773323996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/15ac5ff5b4df17a75e9ca7b9c4129f9a.avif?t=1773323996\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a barista and manage your very own coffee shop in <strong>Coffee Express</strong>, a first-person simulation game where every cup matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare delicious drinks, satisfy your customers, and grow your caf\u00e9 into the most beloved coffee spot in town. From grinding beans to crafting the perfect latte, every detail of the coffee-making process is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're carefully following recipes or experimenting with your own style, Coffee Express offers a relaxing and immersive caf\u00e9 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/2de79da92adb57a74120263811b5a559.avif?t=1773323996\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Own Caf\u00e9</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coffee shop, prepare drinks for customers, and build a reputation as the town\u2019s favorite barista.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Coffee Preparation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use authentic tools and machines such as espresso machines, portafilters, and coffee grinders to craft different types of coffee drinks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Barista Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drink requires multiple steps and ingredients. Master the workflow and create the perfect cup every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Requests and Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may ask for something special, draw latte art, write funny messages on cups, or experiment with different combinations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Types of Equipment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, new equipment will find its place in your cafe. You will use not only coffee-making equipment, but also different types of equipment to run your cafe.</p>","developers":["Fat Cat Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/95191468bc554f86ccd3182e25579b5ba24bb41f/header.jpg?t=1773323996","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=